pipeline-reqa-sql
Local Text-to-SQL Agent — query any relational database in natural language.
100% local, zero data leaves your machine.

Pipeline Architecture
User Query (natural language)
        │
        ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  1. Embedding     │  ← local fastembed (BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5, CPU)
└────────┬──────────┘
         │ vector
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────────────────┐
│  2. Schema RAG    │◄───│  Qdrant (local Vector DB)   │
│  (top-k tables)   │    │  + full table list           │
└────────┬──────────┘    └─────────────────────────────┘
         │ contextualized schema
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  3. SQL Generator │  ← LLM (Ollama/Mistral, 100% local)
│     (LLM #1)      │    generates SQL from question + schema
└────────┬──────────┘
         │ raw SQL
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  4. Static Check  │  ← sqlglot (MariaDB syntax + SELECT-only)
│   (sqlglot)       │    if invalid → retry to SQL Generator (max 3x)
└────────┬──────────┘
         │ valid SQL
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  5. EXPLAIN       │  ← MariaDB EXPLAIN (dry-run, zero data read)
│   (dry-run)       │    if failure → Circuit Breaker → Graceful Failure
└────────┬──────────┘
         │ plan OK
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐
│  6. DB Execution  │◄───│  MariaDB 11.4    │
│                   │    │  (local SQL DB)  │
└────────┬──────────┘    └──────────────────┘
         │ raw results (rows)
         ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  7. Renderer      │  ← LLM (Ollama/Mistral, same model)
│     (LLM #2)      │    formats results into a natural language response
└────────┬──────────┘
         │
         ▼
   Final Response

─────────────────────────────
Circuit Breaker (cross-cutting)
  → opens after 3 consecutive failures (EXPLAIN or Execution)
  → Graceful Failure: clear message to the user
─────────────────────────────

