Text-to-SQL recommendation: codestral (specialized) or phi4:14b (high-performance all-rounder).

ollama pull mistral                 # default
ollama pull codestral               # best for text-to-SQL
ollama pull phi4                    # best general quality
ollama pull codellama:7b            # alternative for code
ollama pull llama3.1:8b             # general-purpose
Important: Increasing the context size of the model
Models are setup by default to work on with a smaller context size than what they are capable.
codestral is set a 4KB by default, but it is capable of 32 KB.
4KB is way too small for the project. codestral is capable of 32kb.
Create a file 'codestral_32k.modelfile', and write the following content
FROM codestral:latest
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
ollama model create codestral_32k -f codestral_32k.modelfile
